  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cities and Infrastructure for Growth (CIG) - Innovation &amp; Investment Fund (I2F) Piloting innovative interventions that could attract large scale future investments. Resource spend subject to Departmental Expenditure Limits. ICF attributable.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Cities and Infrastructure for Growth (CIG) - Innovation &amp; Investment Fund (I2F) Piloting innovative interventions that could attract large scale future investments. Resource spend subject to Departmental Expenditure Limits. ICF attributable. is a component of Cities and Infrastructure for Growth (CIG) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xa3;1,601,873. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Urban development and management, Solar energy for centralised grids, Transport policy and administrative management, Environmental policy and administrative management.</narrative>
  </description>
